      "url": "https://www.countrylife.co.uk/property/why-build-a-new-country-house",
      "title": "🔓 [Country Life] Why build a new country house? There's a long list of things you'll gain if you can live without that lovely patina of age",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/pkHkT2YdVtTXuCc9TUd2Ej-1920-80.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🌲 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.countrylife.co.uk%2Fproperty%2Fwhy-build-a-new-country-house\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\nTo celebrate the publication of a book on houses he has designed, George Saumarez Smith reflects on why some people choose new rather than historic homes. Photographs by Peter Dixon.",
