      "title": "[New Atlas] 24-ft tiny house finds space to squeeze in three bedrooms",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5b0c24b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3000x1575+0+212/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd8%2F61%2F328e7d1f44439cf536c978b20f84%2Favalon-update-tiny-home-1.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p><img alt=\"The updated Avalon 24' tiny house, by Dragon Tiny Homes, squeezes three sleeping spaces into a remarkably compact footprint\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d08dec1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3000x1999+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd8%2F61%2F328e7d1f44439cf536c978b20f84%2Favalon-update-tiny-home-1.png\"/><p>A downstairs bedroom is already a luxury in a tiny house, doubly so in this model, which also somehow manages to find room for two lofts and an open layout despite having a modest length of just 24 ft (7.3 m).</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/avalon-24-updated-dragon-tiny-homes/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/\">Tiny Houses</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/\">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/\" rel=\"tag\">Building and Construction</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/tiny-footprint/\" rel=\"tag\">Tiny Footprint</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/micro-housing/\" rel=\"tag\">Micro-House</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/danish-mirror-house/21118/\" rel=\"tag\">House</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/home/\" rel=\"tag\">Home</a></p></p>",
      "date_published": "2026-10-04T08:03:00+00:00",
