      "title": "[Dezeen] Luxury ocean liners inform New York's Kimpton Era hotel by INC",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"http://static.dezeen.com/uploads/2026/10/rocco-kimpton-era_inc_dezeen_sqex-411x411.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p>Local architecture studio INC has designed each guest room at this hotel overlooking New York's Rockefeller Plaza to emulate \"a stateroom on an ocean liner\". The 529-key Kimpton Era is housed within a purpose-built, 33-storey tower on West 48th Street, just south of the art deco Rockefeller Center complex. For the interiors, INC pulled in</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/03/kimpton-era-hotel-new-york-city-inc/\">Luxury ocean liners inform New York's Kimpton Era hotel by INC</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com\">Dezeen</a>.</p>",
